# Never send secrets or local state into an image build. The Dockerfile copies
# an explicit file list; these patterns are a second line of defence. `**/`
# matters: in .dockerignore a bare `*.pem` matches only at the context root
# (security-check L-1). Keep the secret entries in step with .gitignore.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/.envrc
**/.npmrc
deploy/*.env
**/*.pw
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.log
# database dumps (password and session hashes, document content)
**/*.dump
**/*.backup
**/*.sql.gz
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
coverage
test-results
playwright-report
docs/assets/screenshots
